        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-GNT625SMTSBR, Elegant Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Appliance Door Pull comes from First Impression's Garnet Collection. It is comes packaged with everything you need to install on an appliance door panel 3/4 inches up to 1 inch thick. Choose from 8 inch, 10 inch, or 12 inch lengths in a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Garnet Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262220\"><b>First Impressions AP-GNT625SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625008SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625010SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625012SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
